---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// The three supplied colour variants of the "Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org"
// badge. `preview` is a proportionally resized WebP for on-page display; `file`
// is the unmodified full-size PNG offered for download. The badge wording is
// fixed artwork and is deliberately not renamed alongside the Enhanced Listing
// tier. See the note in the "How to qualify" section below.
const badges = [
  {
    id: 'transparent-bg',
    label: 'Transparent background',
    note: 'Full colour artwork on a transparent background. Works on any background colour.',
    file: '/images/badges/featured-on-walton-on-thames-org-transparent-bg.png',
    preview: '/images/badges/featured-on-walton-on-thames-org-transparent-bg-preview.webp',
    width: 560,
    height: 560,
  },
  {
    id: 'blue',
    label: 'Navy background',
    note: 'Cream artwork on a solid navy background. Best on light or white pages.',
    file: '/images/badges/featured-on-walton-on-thames-org-blue.png',
    preview: '/images/badges/featured-on-walton-on-thames-org-blue-preview.webp',
    width: 560,
    height: 560,
  },
  {
    id: 'mono',
    label: 'Black and white',
    note: 'Single colour artwork on a transparent background, for monochrome designs.',
    file: '/images/badges/featured-on-walton-on-thames-org-mono.png',
    preview: '/images/badges/featured-on-walton-on-thames-org-mono-preview.webp',
    width: 560,
    height: 553,
  },
];

const exampleSnippet = `<a href="https://walton-on-thames.org/directory/your-listing/">
  <img src="featured-on-walton-on-thames-org.png"
       alt="Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org"
       width="180" height="180">
</a>`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="How to Submit an Enhanced Listing"
  description="Enhanced Listings on Walton-on-Thames.org are completely free and always will be. Add the Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org badge to your site to qualify."
>
  <slot name="structured-data">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://walton-on-thames.org/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Directory", "item": "https://walton-on-thames.org/directory/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "Enhanced Listing", "item": "https://walton-on-thames.org/directory/enhanced-listing/" }
      ]
    })} />
  </slot>

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="breadcrumbs">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/directory/">Directory</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">Enhanced Listing</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1>How to submit an Enhanced Listing</h1>
      <p>An Enhanced Listing gives you more control over how your business or organisation is presented on Walton-on-Thames.org.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container enhanced-layout">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>An Enhanced Listing gives you more control over how your business or organisation is presented on Walton-on-Thames.org. You can add a custom description, your own photographs, embedded videos and links to your reviews or booking page.</p>

        <p class="free-banner"><strong>Enhanced Listings are completely free and always will be.</strong></p>

        <h2>What is included</h2>
        <ul class="tick-list">
          <li>✓ Everything in Standard</li>
          <li>✓ Custom description</li>
          <li>✓ Your own photographs</li>
          <li>✓ Embedded videos or links to your own videos</li>
          <li>✓ Links to your reviews or booking page</li>
        </ul>
        <p>An Enhanced Listing does not receive preferential category ranking simply because it is enhanced. The distinction is the additional content available within the listing, not paid or preferential placement.</p>

        <h2>How to qualify</h2>
        <p>To qualify for an Enhanced Listing, you must add the "Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org" badge to your own website and link it directly to your business or organisation's listing on Walton-on-Thames.org.</p>
        <p>That is it. It is super easy and, best of all, it is totally free and always will be.</p>

        <h3>Choose a badge</h3>
        <p>Three colour variants are available. Please use the artwork as supplied, without cropping, recolouring or otherwise altering it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="badge-grid" role="list">
        {badges.map(badge => (
          <div class="badge-card" role="listitem">
            <img
              src={badge.preview}
              alt="Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org"
              width={badge.width}
              height={badge.height}
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="badge-image"
            />
            <h3 class="badge-label">{badge.label}</h3>
            <p class="badge-note">{badge.note}</p>
            <a href={badge.file} download class="btn btn-outline badge-download">
              Download PNG
              <span class="sr-only"> of the {badge.label.toLowerCase()} Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org badge</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="prose">
        <h3>Link the badge to your own listing</h3>
        <p>The badge must link to your individual directory listing on Walton-on-Thames.org, not simply to the Walton-on-Thames.org homepage. Your listing URL is the address of your own page in the directory, and it looks like <code>https://walton-on-thames.org/directory/your-business-name/</code>. You can find it by opening your listing from the <a href="/directory/">directory</a> and copying the address from your browser.</p>

        <h4>Example</h4>
        <div class="code-block">
          <pre><code>{exampleSnippet}</code></pre>
        </div>
        <p>Save the badge image to your own website rather than linking to the copy hosted here, and keep the alternative text as "Featured on Walton-on-Thames.org".</p>

        <h2>Standard Listings and events do not need the badge</h2>
        <p>The badge is only relevant to Enhanced Listings. A Standard Listing in the directory is free and requires nothing in return, and submitting a local event is free and requires nothing in return. You are welcome to use the badge either way, but it is never a condition of appearing on the site.</p>

        <h2>Apply for an Enhanced Listing</h2>
        <p>When your badge is live on your website, send us the details below using the contact form and choose <strong>Enhanced Listing application</strong> as the subject. Every application is manually reviewed, as all submissions to this site are.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your business or organisation name</li>
          <li>The URL of your existing Walton-on-Thames.org listing</li>
          <li>The page on your website where you have added the badge</li>
          <li>Your custom description</li>
          <li>Your photographs</li>
          <li>Links to any videos, reviews or booking pages you want included</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If your business is not in the directory yet, <a href="/advertise-your-business/">request a free Standard Listing</a> first.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="enhanced-cta">
        <p>Ready to apply? Enhanced Listings are free, and always will be.</p>
        <a href="/contact/?subject=enhanced-listing" class="btn btn-primary">Apply for an Enhanced Listing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .enhanced-layout {
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .free-banner {
    background: rgba(184,134,46,0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(184,134,46,0.35);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1rem 1.375rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }

  .tick-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .badge-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .badge-card {
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .badge-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 200px;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }

  .badge-label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .badge-note {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-slate);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .badge-download {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .code-block {
    overflow-x: auto;
    background: var(--color-navy-ink);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .code-block pre {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .code-block code {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #E6EDF0;
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .enhanced-layout :global(code) {
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    background: rgba(11,36,46,0.06);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .code-block :global(code) {
    background: none;
    padding: 0;
    word-break: normal;
  }

  .enhanced-layout h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .enhanced-cta {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .enhanced-cta p {
    color: var(--color-slate);
  }
</style>
